1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,514
Howdy, y'all.

2
00:00:01,514 --> 00:00:05,412
Welcome to marriage counselling, sorry, robot calibration.

3
00:00:05,412 --> 00:00:08,753
Same expensive relationship, fewer anniversary arguments.

4
00:00:08,753 --> 00:00:16,550
This adults-only training draft covers cup pickup, camera cleaning and tube holding on your

5
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:17,664
VMS V300.

6
00:00:17,664 --> 00:00:21,005
Some position close-ups still need filming.

7
00:00:21,005 --> 00:00:24,903
Let's get this expensive bastard lined up.

8
00:00:26,146 --> 00:00:30,698
Safety briefing? I threw that shit out. Kidding. Put it back.

9
00:00:30,698 --> 00:00:33,181
This robot hasn't got a conscience.

10
00:00:33,181 --> 00:00:38,146
Only do this if you've been shown how to do it safely.

11
00:00:38,146 --> 00:00:42,698
Stay outside the arm area unless the switch is in Safe.

12
00:00:42,698 --> 00:00:48,491
Keep out of the stall and gate movement area until remote control is blocked.

13
00:00:48,491 --> 00:00:52,215
In Run, the arm can move at any time.

14
00:00:52,215 --> 00:00:54,284
Lock does not stop it.

15
00:00:55,652 --> 00:01:00,618
At the control box, set the mode switch to Run if needed.

16
00:01:00,618 --> 00:01:03,100
Check the yellow light is on.

17
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:05,169
Keep clear of the arm.

18
00:01:06,476 --> 00:01:09,927
On the InControl screen, select the correct station.

19
00:01:09,927 --> 00:01:13,810
Choose Manual, Closed Stall, from the robot mode menu.

20
00:01:13,810 --> 00:01:16,398
Let the cow finish and leave.

21
00:01:16,398 --> 00:01:20,280
Wait for an empty stall and Manual on screen.

22
00:01:21,459 --> 00:01:24,026
Press Lock on the control box.

23
00:01:24,026 --> 00:01:30,016
Check the white Lock light comes on, and this robot shows the lock symbol.

24
00:01:30,016 --> 00:01:33,012
This prevents another screen from taking control.

25
00:01:33,012 --> 00:01:35,579
More commitment than my first marriage.

26
00:01:36,758 --> 00:01:40,819
Keep clear: the arm moves immediately when calibration starts.

27
00:01:40,819 --> 00:01:47,136
On this panel, press the top-left and bottom-left buttons of the left-hand group together.

28
00:01:47,136 --> 00:01:51,649
That's Entrance Gate and Teat Cleaning, beside the gearwheel symbol.

29
00:01:51,649 --> 00:01:54,808
The arm moves to teat cup one.

30
00:01:55,986 --> 00:01:58,547
These buttons now have different jobs.

31
00:01:58,547 --> 00:02:02,814
Follow the four teat-button arrows to move the arm across.

32
00:02:02,814 --> 00:02:04,948
Exit Gate moves it up.

33
00:02:04,948 --> 00:02:07,081
Feed Portion moves it down.

34
00:02:07,081 --> 00:02:08,788
Teat Cleaning is Confirm.

35
00:02:08,788 --> 00:02:10,495
Entrance Gate is Cancel.

36
00:02:10,495 --> 00:02:12,202
Same buttons, new chores.

37
00:02:12,202 --> 00:02:16,043
My wife said let's try something different last night.

38
00:02:16,043 --> 00:02:18,176
Handed me a fucking mop.

39
00:02:19,374 --> 00:02:23,512
Check how the gripper lines up with the cup handle.

40
00:02:23,512 --> 00:02:24,753
Tap Confirm once.

41
00:02:24,753 --> 00:02:26,822
You'll hear the gripper click.

42
00:02:26,822 --> 00:02:30,546
If the position is right, press and hold Confirm.

43
00:02:30,546 --> 00:02:33,443
The arm moves to the next position.

44
00:02:34,664 --> 00:02:35,905
Need an adjustment?

45
00:02:35,905 --> 00:02:39,215
Tap an arrow for a small move across.

46
00:02:39,215 --> 00:02:42,112
Holding the button keeps the arm moving.

47
00:02:42,112 --> 00:02:44,595
Use Up or Down for height.

48
00:02:44,595 --> 00:02:47,491
Tap Confirm and check the gripper again.

49
00:02:47,491 --> 00:02:50,388
When it's right, press and hold Confirm.

50
00:02:50,388 --> 00:02:50,801
Patience.

51
00:02:50,801 --> 00:02:52,870
This ain't a damn rodeo.

52
00:02:54,061 --> 00:02:58,700
Repeat for the remaining teat cups and the teat cleaning cup.

53
00:02:58,700 --> 00:03:00,809
Cancel keeps the existing position.

54
00:03:00,809 --> 00:03:01,653
Steady pickups.

55
00:03:01,653 --> 00:03:06,714
Finally, something on this farm with a better pickup game than me.

56
00:03:07,893 --> 00:03:12,560
After the teat cleaning cup, the arm moves to camera cleaning.

57
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:15,954
The glass must press gently against the sponge.

58
00:03:15,954 --> 00:03:20,197
Adjust with the same arrows, then press and hold Confirm.

59
00:03:20,197 --> 00:03:23,167
Too much pressure can damage the glass.

60
00:03:23,167 --> 00:03:25,288
Too little won't clean properly.

61
00:03:25,288 --> 00:03:29,107
A broken camera costs more than a dirty weekend.

62
00:03:30,285 --> 00:03:36,324
Check the arm's tube supports, called horns, against the tubes in the rack.

63
00:03:36,324 --> 00:03:40,969
Adjust with the same arrows, then press and hold Confirm.

64
00:03:40,969 --> 00:03:43,757
Repeat for the second tube-holding position.

65
00:03:43,757 --> 00:03:47,008
The arm returns to its usual position.

66
00:03:47,008 --> 00:03:48,867
The screen shows Manual.

67
00:03:50,045 --> 00:03:53,999
Time to bury the evidence, sorry, check our homework.

68
00:03:53,999 --> 00:03:57,074
Keep the stall empty and everyone clear.

69
00:03:57,074 --> 00:04:00,588
On the InControl screen, open Maintenance, then Test.

70
00:04:00,588 --> 00:04:04,103
Tap Milk Cups to test the milk cups.

71
00:04:04,103 --> 00:04:06,299
Also test Teat Cleaning Cup.

72
00:04:06,299 --> 00:04:09,813
Buttons one to four test individual milk cups.

73
00:04:09,813 --> 00:04:12,010
Watch each pickup and release.

74
00:04:13,189 --> 00:04:14,550
Tap Camera Cleaning.

75
00:04:14,550 --> 00:04:18,636
Watch it clean against the sponge, rinse and return.

76
00:04:18,636 --> 00:04:19,998
Tap Hold Tubes.

77
00:04:19,998 --> 00:04:23,630
Watch the arm move into position and return.

78
00:04:23,630 --> 00:04:25,446
Check both work correctly.

79
00:04:25,446 --> 00:04:29,986
If the arm shakes or moves jerkily, contact DeLaval service.

80
00:04:29,986 --> 00:04:32,710
Hope is a bullshit maintenance plan.

81
00:04:33,906 --> 00:04:37,216
When the checks are complete, press Lock again.

82
00:04:37,216 --> 00:04:39,699
Check the white light goes off.

83
00:04:39,699 --> 00:04:41,768
Choose the intended operating mode.

84
00:04:41,768 --> 00:04:45,492
The control lock stays on until you release it.

85
00:04:45,492 --> 00:04:46,733
Back to work.

86
00:04:46,733 --> 00:04:53,354
The bank wants its money, and apparently telling them to get fucked isn't a payment plan.
